# EstateCraft Environment Variables

Copy to `.env` in the project root (or per-service `.env` files).

```env
# ─── Database ───────────────────────────────────────────────
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://estatecraft_user:estatecraft_password@localhost:5432/estatecraft

# ─── API Gateway (svc-api) ──────────────────────────────────
PORT=3000
NODE_ENV=development
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://localhost:3000
JWT_SECRET=change-this-in-production-use-strong-random-string
JWT_EXPIRES_IN=24h
LOG_LEVEL=debug
AUTO_SEED=true

# ─── Multi-tenant SaaS ──────────────────────────────────────
# Tenant hostnames: {slug}.estatecraft.io
SAAS_BASE_DOMAIN=estatecraft.io
PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3000
# Ops key for POST /api/tenants
PLATFORM_ADMIN_KEY=dev-platform-admin-key-change-me
# Local only: allow password login on Pro/Enterprise (SSO-required) tenants
TENANT_SSO_PASSWORD_BYPASS=true

# ─── Auth (svc-auth) ────────────────────────────────────────
# Uses same JWT_SECRET and DATABASE_URL

# ─── Voice / Communication Providers ────────────────────────
# Platform default for local/mock. Production Dial keys are per-tenant (BYO).
VOICE_PROVIDER=mock

# Dial (https://getdial.ai) — optional platform fallback; tenants bring their own
DIAL_API_KEY=
DIAL_BASE_URL=https://api.getdial.ai
DIAL_FROM_NUMBER_ID=

# Twilio (future)
TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=
TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER=

# ─── Infrastructure (optional in serverless) ────────────────
RABBITMQ_URL=amqp://estatecraft_user:estatecraft_password@localhost:5672/estatecraft_vhost
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379
SKIP_INFRA=false

# ─── Frontend ───────────────────────────────────────────────
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000
```

## Vercel Production Variables

Set these in the Vercel dashboard:

| Variable | Required | Description |
|----------|----------|-------------|
| `DATABASE_URL` | Yes | PostgreSQL connection (Neon, Supabase, or Vercel Postgres) |
| `JWT_SECRET` | Yes | Strong random secret for auth tokens |
| `SAAS_BASE_DOMAIN` | Yes | `estatecraft.io` |
| `PLATFORM_ADMIN_KEY` | Yes | Secret for tenant provisioning API |
| `TENANT_SSO_PASSWORD_BYPASS` | No | Must be unset/`false` in production |
| `VOICE_PROVIDER` | Yes | `mock` or `dial` |
| `DIAL_API_KEY` | Optional | Platform fallback only; tenants BYO Dial |
| `CORS_ORIGINS` | Yes | Your Vercel deployment URL |
| `SKIP_INFRA` | Yes | `true` on Vercel |
| `NODE_ENV` | Yes | `production` |

**Never commit real API keys or secrets to the repository.**
